    {
      "name": "makeParticles",
      "description": "The seeded drifting glyphs. Swift: BackgroundMath.particles (14, GlyphParticle(seed:glyphCount:)). Kotlin: GlyphParticle.seeded(seed, glyphCount). Each platform seeds its own generator, so positions differ between platforms; the placement maths is the same.",
      "paramStructure": "by-position",
      "params": [
