    {
      "name": "Background",
      "description": "Starts the animated background on a full-window canvas: fills the theme background colour, draws the scene picture, glyphs, specks, glow, vignette and front figures each animation frame. Returns the instance that Background.setTheme, Background.setScene and Background.stop act on; its figures property (default true) shows the front figures. Web (browser): new Background(canvas, theme). Swift: the SwiftUI view ThemeBackgroundView(theme:scene:figures:) in UIKit targets. Kotlin: the Compose function ThemeBackground(theme, scene, figures, modifier).",
